Subject: scroll view: the thumb reveals on user input only

What: the thumb is revealed by wheel, touch, pen and keyboard, not by a viewport
`scroll` event, plus the key handling the app's scroll views share.
Why: assigning scrollTop and virtualizer bottom anchoring dispatch the same event
as a wheel, so hidden retained surfaces ran 200 ms opacity transitions whenever
another session activated.

